Trace how a service gets from source code to runtime

Usage:
  eshu trace service <name> [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string       API key for authentication
      --env string           Runtime environment selector to disambiguate a service name
  -h, --help                 help for service
      --json                 Write the canonical service trace envelope as JSON
      --profile string       Config profile name
      --repo string          Repository selector to disambiguate a service name
      --service-id string    Exact service or workload id to trace instead of the display name
      --service-url string   API service URL (overrides config)

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
